OL,3,GNEWSA'Fair chance' Omagh bomb may have
OL,4,Abeen prevented, senior officer tells
OL,5,Ainquiry
OL,6,
OL,7,FFailure by police to link together a
OL,8,Fpattern of attacks in 1998 may have
OL,9,Fprevented some of those involved being
OL,10,Farrested before the bombing, the
OL,11,Finquiry was told.
